    "The original PBF has one sector claimant for165255 and one parent claimant for1652; its complete original sector geometry is contained by that parent.",
    "INS2012, INS2024 and ISIE2022 all distinguish Zriba Village from the Hammam north/south sectors. This is a missing qualifier, not a homonymous-sector code transfer.",
    "The official ISIE map visibly names the same qualified sector. The generic parent name does not justify merging the sector into base409.",
    "Only derived name tags change. Exact old Arabic/French names remain searchable, the source PBF is untouched, and the compiled geometry/coordinates/context/group IDs must remain unchanged."
  ],
